          "relation": "implies",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 154,
            "text": "theorem gronwall_zero {a b K : ℝ} {E E' : ℝ → ℝ} (hab : a ≤ b)\n    (hcont : ContinuousOn E (Icc a b)) (hinitial : E a = 0)\n    (hnonneg : ∀ t ∈ Icc a b, 0 ≤ E t)\n    (hderiv : ∀ t ∈ Ioo a b, HasDerivAt E (E' t) t)\n    (hbound : ∀ t ∈ Ioo a b, E' t ≤ K * E t) :\n    ∀ t ∈ Icc a b, E t = 0"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
